* parameter file for HyRes amino acid adducts and modified residues
* (e.g. fluorescent dyes attached to Cys); companion of top_adducts.inp.
* Load together with param_hyres_mix.inp and param_metabolome.inp; utils.load_ff('Adduct').
* Dye linker bonded terms fitted from the AA A488-Cys trajectory (FRET/A488/amber);
* bonds inside the rigid phenyl + xanthene are K = 0 placeholders (use createRigidBodies).
*

BOND
!
!V(bond) = Kb(b - b0)**2
!
!Kb: kcal/mole/A**2
!b0: A
!
!atom type    Kb      b0
!## A48/A59 dye linker, Boltzmann inversion (moment matched, 300 K) of the AA A488-Cys
!## trajectory (FRET/A488/amber, 26110 frames; bonddist.xvg, A04-A05/A05-A06 from cg.xtc)
P1C   M07      9.81    2.777  ! CB-A01
M07   M07    495.82    2.899  ! A01-A02 (succinimide)
C3E   M07    258.97    2.300  ! A01-A03 and A02-A03 (shared); overrides param_metabolome C3E-M07
A2V   C3E      8.78    2.959  ! A03-A04; overrides param_metabolome C3E-A2V
A2V   M03      2.78    3.628  ! A04-A05; overrides param_metabolome M03-A2V
M03   XAR    267.79    2.700  ! A05-A06
!## bonds inside the rigid phenyl + xanthene body (createRigidBodies): placeholders, K = 0
XAR   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A48/A59 ring bonds
XAN   XAR      0.00    1.000
QAD   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A07-A09 carboxylate
P1W   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A48
MSO   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A48
MSO   P1W      0.00    1.000  ! A48
A2V   A2Y      0.00    1.000  ! A59
A2V   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A59
A2Y   MSO      0.00    1.000  ! A59
A2Y   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A59
M06   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A59

THETAS
!
!V(angle) = Ktheta(Theta - Theta0)**2
!
!Ktheta: kcal/mole/rad**2
!Theta0: degrees
!
!atom types     Ktheta    Theta0
!## A48/A59 dye linker; ReB angles (V = K (t-t0)^2/sin^2 t), K and t0 chosen so the 300 K
!## distribution reproduces the AA mean and standard deviation (angle_0-4.xvg)
P1C   M07   M07     17.23     92.1  ! CB-A01-A02     (AA  91.9 +-  7.1)
M07   C3E   A2V      4.07    128.7  ! A02-A03-A04    (AA 122.3 +- 12.3)
C3E   A2V   M03      1.27    162.2  ! A03-A04-A05    (AA 138.0 +- 19.9)
A2V   M03   XAR      3.19    129.1  ! A04-A05-A06    (AA 121.4 +- 13.6)
M03   XAR   XAR      9.97    172.2  ! A05-A06-A08    (AA 170.9 +-  2.2)

PHI
!
!V(dihedral) = Kchi(1 + cos(n(chi) - delta))
!
!Kchi: kcal/mole
!n: multiplicity
!delta: degrees
!
!atom types             Kchi    n   delta
!## A48/A59 dye linker; Boltzmann inversion of dihed_0-5.xvg (300 K), 3-term Fourier fit
P1C   M07   M07   C3E     1.501   1   -35.4  ! CB-A01-A02-A03
P1C   M07   M07   C3E     1.337   2   112.8
P1C   M07   M07   C3E     1.072   3   -89.3
M07   M07   C3E   A2V     1.782   1     3.1  ! A01-A02-A03-A04
M07   M07   C3E   A2V     1.012   2     0.5
M07   M07   C3E   A2V     0.466   3  -175.2
M07   C3E   A2V   M03     0.138   1   158.1  ! A01-A03-A04-A05
M07   C3E   A2V   M03     0.055   2    33.3
M07   C3E   A2V   M03     0.109   3  -168.7
C3E   A2V   M03   XAR     0.136   1  -168.7  ! A03-A04-A05-A06
C3E   A2V   M03   XAR     0.209   2   171.6
C3E   A2V   M03   XAR     0.159   3     0.0
A2V   M03   XAR   XAR     1.813   1     0.0  ! A04-A05-A06-A08
A2V   M03   XAR   XAR     0.516   2    -1.7
A2V   M03   XAR   XAR     0.134   3    -4.1
M03   XAR   XAR   XAR    11.916   1   177.3  ! A05-A06-A08-A07
M03   XAR   XAR   XAR     3.023   2   -10.0
M03   XAR   XAR   XAR     0.231   3   132.8

IMPHI
!
!V(improper) = Kpsi(psi - psi0)**2
!
!Kpsi: kcal/mole/rad**2
!psi0: degrees
!
!atom types           Kpsi                   psi0

NONBONDED  NBXMOD 5  ATOM CDIEL SWITCH VATOM VDISTANCE VSWITCH -
     CUTNB 12.0  CTOFNB 12.0  CTONNB 11.0

!
!V(Lennard-Jones) = Eps,i,j[(Rmin,i,j/ri,j)**12 - 2(Rmin,i,j/ri,j)**6]
!
!epsilon: kcal/mole, Eps,i,j = sqrt(eps,i * eps,j)
!Rmin/2: A, Rmin,i,j = Rmin/2,i + Rmin/2,j
!
!atom  ignored    epsilon      Rmin/2   ignored   eps,1-4       Rmin/2,1-4
!
!## dye beads
XAN      0.00     -0.0880      2.3444   0.00     -0.0810       2.3444 ! dye xanthene C9; generic LJ as A4H, stacking via NBFIX XAN pairs
XAR      0.00     -0.0880      2.3444   0.00     -0.0810       2.3444 ! dye aromatic ring bead, LJ as A4H

NBFIX
!                 Emin         Rmin
!                 (kcal/mol)   (A)

END
